  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4298c1582b1a1b6428acd6f21334c2fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: ArthurM1R1 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Name:
    textVI: Arthur
    textEN: Arthur
  CharSprite: {fileID: -7441139868736287282, guid: 3fb32fc0d0568c84889ab091781a1772, type: 3}
  DialogueLines:
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "Khung c\u1EA3nh \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o? C\xF3 gi\u1ED1ng
      trong t\u01B0\u1EDFng t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu kh\xF4ng?"
    textEN: '"How do you find the view here, young man? Is it what you imagined?"'
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 1
    textVI: "Ho\xE0n to\xE0n kh\xF4ng gi\u1ED1ng, n\xF3 qu\xE1 t\u0103m t\u1ED1i
      v\xE0 \u1EA9m th\u1EA5p so v\u1EDBi h\xECnh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng c\xE2y th\u1EBF
      gi\u1EDBi thi\xEAng li\xEAng trong \u0111\u1EA7u t\xF4i."
    textEN: 'Not at all. It is far too dark and damp compared to the sacred World
      Tree I had in mind.



'
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "Haha, n\u01A1i \u0111\xE2y kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\xEAn trong c\xE2y th\u1EBF
      gi\u1EDBi, m\xE0 l\xE0 th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi n\xF3, n\u01A1i
      ch\xF4n v\xF9i c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t th\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA1i \u0111\xE3 t\u1EEBng
      r\u1EA5t huy ho\xE0ng."
    textEN: "Haha, we are not within the World Tree, but in the realm below\u2014where
      a once-magnificent age lies buried."
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 1
    textVI: "C\u1EA3m gi\xE1c nh\u01B0 c\xF3 th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 lu\xF4n theo
      d\xF5i t\xF4i t\u1EEB trong b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i v\u1EADy"
    textEN: It feels as though something is constantly stalking me from the darkness.
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "Haha, \"nh\u0169ng th\u1EE9 \u0111\xF3\" l\xE0 t\xE0n d\u01B0 c\u1EE7a
      th\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EA1i c\u0169 \u0111\xF3, ch\xFAc c\u1EADu s\u1EDBm t\xECm
      ra ch\xE2n t\u01B0\u1EDBng! "
    textEN: Haha, 'those things' are the remnants of the old era. I wish you luck
      in uncovering the truth soon!
    autoSkip: 0
  - IsYou: 0
    textVI: "N\u01A1i t\u1EADn c\xF9ng c\u1EE7a con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\xE0y,
      s\u1EBD c\xF3 th\u1EE9 c\u1EADu c\u1EA7n, n\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi
      l\xE0 \"v\u1EA5n t\xE2m quan\"!"
    textEN: At the very end of this road, you will find what you need. It is known
      as the 'Gate of the Searching Heart'!
    autoSkip: 0
  EndDialogue: 
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  VoiceSound: {fileID: 0}
  VoicePitch: 1
  IsActivated: 0
